StarFile Explorer
=================

StarFile Explorer is a fork of Swift Explorer
(https://github.com/misutesu-desu/swift-explorer),
Copyright (c) 2026 Abdullah Şafer.

The original project is released under the MIT License. That license is kept
unchanged for the code inherited from it, and the original copyright notice is
reproduced in LICENSE next to the copyright of this fork. Every file in this
repository is available under the same MIT terms.

What this fork changes: application name, icon, application identifier
(`io.github.some_rao.StarFile`), installer and update channel, and the window
chrome work (work-area clamp for the maximized window, no DWM caption strip).
The feature set and architecture come from the original project.

